{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27799","headline":"寄陈去疾进士 · 欧阳衮","name":"寄陈去疾进士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"放迹疑辞垢，栖心亦道门。\n玄言萝幌馥，诗思竹炉温。\n解带摇花落，弹琴散鸟喧。\n江山兹夕意，唯有素交存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}